# Moved to the repository root. The Supabase CLI reads env(...) values for
# supabase/config.toml from a .env file at the project root, not from
# supabase/.env. Use the root example instead:
#
#   cp .env.example .env      # run from the repository root
#   npx supabase start
#
# This file is intentionally comment-only so nothing here is ever loaded as a
# config value. See ../.env.example for the three Twilio Verify placeholders.
